# Popup UI

## Stack

React 18 + Vite. Built output: `popup/dist/` (manifest points here). Tailwind in `popup/src/styles/globals.css`.

## Structure

- `App.jsx` — views: dashboard, review, queue, history, settings; `fullPage` for workspace
- `components/site/` — `SiteShell.jsx`, `SitePageHeader.jsx` (sidebar nav on dashboard)
- `components/WorkspaceTabJobs.jsx` — open browser tabs → bulk queue (`fullPage` only)
- `components/settings/CvTemplateEditor.jsx` — Visual / HTML / DOCX import for CV template
- `components/` — UI only; no direct AI fetch
- `hooks/` — `useStorage`, `useApplications`, `useLicense`, `useJobQueue`
- `web/` + `vite.web.config.js` — localhost dashboard (`npm run web:dev`); `WebConnect.jsx` for extension ID

## Patterns

- Extension pages: `chrome.runtime.sendMessage`
- Localhost web: `sendExtensionMessage` from `lib/extension-env.js` (requires linked extension ID)
- Messages: `GENERATE_APPLICATION`, `FILL_FORM`, `PROCESS_QUEUE`, `LIST_JOB_TABS`, `ADD_TABS_TO_QUEUE`
- Use `getStorage` / `setStorage` / `mergeStorage` from `lib/storage.js`
- License paywall: `LicenseGate.jsx` when free tier exhausted

## Do not

- Call Anthropic/OpenAI from popup (CSP + architecture)
- Use class components or inline `chrome.storage` in components
- Reference `popup/src/` paths in manifest — only `popup/dist/` after build

## After UI changes

`npm run build` (or `npm run dev`) then reload extension on `chrome://extensions`.
